[00:36.64]Why do the stars shine so bright in the sky
[00:41.93]倘若大多数人在夜晚时分酣眠
[00:41.93]If most of the people are sleeping at night
[00:48.36]那为什么天空里的星星闪烁着璀璨的光芒
[00:48.36]Why do we only have one chance at life
